{"name":"Dust Bunny","hex":"#c8b6a6","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"dust bunny","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small clump of dust, fluff, hair, particles of skin, etc., that tends to accumulate indoors in areas not regularly dusted, such as under heavy furniture."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dust_bunny"}],"entries":[{"title":"Dust Bunny","blocks":[{"text":"Dust Bunny is a 2025 American independent fantasy action film written, produced, and directed by Bryan Fuller in his feature film directorial debut. It stars Mads Mikkelsen, Sophie Sloan, Sheila Atim, David Dastmalchian, and Sigourney Weaver. It follows a hit man who is approached by an eight-year-old girl to kill the \"monster\" under her bed that she claims \"ate\" her family."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/ce/Dust_Bunny_film_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dust_Bunny"},{"title":"Dust","blocks":[{"text":"Dust is made of fine particles of solid matter. On Earth, it generally consists of particles in the atmosphere that come from various sources such as soil lifted by wind, volcanic eruptions, and pollution."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Dust_storm_approaching_Stratford%2C_Texas.jpg/330px-Dust_storm_approaching_Stratford%2C_Texas.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dust"},{"title":"Rabbit","blocks":[{"text":"Rabbits, or bunnies, are small mammals in the family Leporidae, which is in the order Lagomorpha. They are familiar throughout the world as a small herbivore, a prey animal, a domesticated form of livestock, and a pet, having a widespread effect on ecologies and cultures. The most widespread rabbit genera are Oryctolagus and Sylvilagus. The former, Oryctolagus, includes the European rabbit, Oryctolagus cuniculus, which is the ancestor of the hundreds of breeds of domestic rabbit and has been introduced on every continent except Antarctica. The latter, Sylvilagus, includes over 13 wild rabbit species, among them the cottontails and tapetis. Wild rabbits not included in Oryctolagus and Sylvilagus include several species of limited distribution, including the pygmy rabbit, volcano rabbit, and Sumatran striped rabbit."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Oryctolagus_cuniculus_Rcdo.jpg/330px-Oryctolagus_cuniculus_Rcdo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rabbit"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/DustDeposition.png/330px-DustDeposition.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/DustDeposition.png/330px-DustDeposition.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Global oceanic distribution of dust deposition","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADustDeposition.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Dust2017.png/500px-Dust2017.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Dust2017.png/500px-Dust2017.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Map of dust in 2017","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADust2017.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Laptop_dust.jpg/500px-Laptop_dust.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Laptop_dust.jpg/1280px-Laptop_dust.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Laptop_dust.jpg/500px-Laptop_dust.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Three years of use without cleaning has caused this laptop heat sink to become clogged with dust, such that it can no longer be used.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALaptop_dust.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/Hausstaub_auf_einem_Finger.jpg/500px-Hausstaub_auf_einem_Finger.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/Hausstaub_auf_einem_Finger.jpg/1280px-Hausstaub_auf_einem_Finger.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/Hausstaub_auf_einem_Finger.jpg/500px-Hausstaub_auf_einem_Finger.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Domestic dust on a finger","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHausstaub_auf_einem_Finger.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Dust_storm_over_Libya.jpg/500px-Dust_storm_over_Libya.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Dust_storm_over_Libya.jpg/1280px-Dust_storm_over_Libya.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Dust_storm_over_Libya.jpg/500px-Dust_storm_over_Libya.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Large dust storm over Libya","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADust_storm_over_Libya.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Debris_netting.JPG/500px-Debris_netting.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Debris_netting.JPG/1280px-Debr